QUESTION 05:
CPU and Memory Resource Limiting Algorithm
Pseudocode:
  BEGIN
  INPUT application_list
  FOR each application IN application_list DO
      CREATE cgroup for application
      SET CPU limit for application
      SET memory limit for application
      ASSIGN application process to cgroup
      MONITOR CPU usage
      MONITOR memory usage
      IF CPU usage exceeds CPU limit THEN
          THROTTLE CPU usage
      ENDIF
      IF memory usage exceeds memory limit THEN
          REDUCE memory allocation
      ENDIF
  ENDFOR
  DISPLAY "CPU and memory usage are successfully regulated"
  END
